@section tel_files APIs supported by the Simulation framework
- - -

-SMS: ISmsManager,ISmsListener, ISmscAddressCallback, SmsMessage<br>
-Card: ICardApp, ICardFileHandler, ICardManager, ICardListener, ICard<br>
-Subscription: ISubscriptionManager, ISubscriptionListener, ISubscription<br>
-Phone: IPhoneManager, IPhone <br>

